1
00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:05,003
(Leonard:)We're not encouraging.
It's more like knuckling under.

2
00:00:05,546 --> 00:00:09,176
I like hanging out but I'm not gonna
apologize for something I didn't do.

3
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:12,512
(Leonard:)Well, actually, technically you did do it.

4
00:00:14,138 --> 00:00:16,428
(Penny:)That's strike one, Leonard.

5
00:00:17,558 --> 00:00:19,598
(Penny:)Here you go. Quesadilla.

6
00:00:19,769 --> 00:00:20,899
(Penny:)Salad.

7
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:22,442
(Penny:)Here's your pizza.

8
00:00:22,605 --> 00:00:25,855
(Penny:)And thanks to Sheldon's heated discussion
with my manager...

9
00:00:26,025 --> 00:00:30,195
(Sheldon:)...barbecue bacon cheeseburger, barbecue
sauce, bacon and cheese on the side.

10
00:00:30,655 --> 00:00:32,485
(Penny:)Thank you.

11
00:00:33,074 --> 00:00:34,204
(Penny:)Go ahead. Eat it.

12
00:00:39,497 --> 00:00:41,327
(Penny:)I dare you.

13
00:00:48,255 --> 00:00:52,425
(Howard:)That's it. There's the house.
I found America's top models!

14
